{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15301870","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15301870","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1530187001:1":{"text":"그게 무슨... 로어테일은 죽지 않았어요! 절대로요!","source_cn":"你……你胡说！吼尾没有死，没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D410B56F749E2A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1530187002:1":{"text":"분명 도망쳤을 거예요. 아니면... 다쳐서 어디선가 움직이지 못하고 있는 걸 거예요.","source_cn":"他一定是逃走了，或者……或者受了伤，在哪里动不了了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B65987EEA3FC466","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530187003:1":{"text":"조금 쉬고 나서 찾으러 갈 거예요. 제가 반드시 찾아내고 말겠어요...","source_cn":"等我休息好，我就出发去找他。我一定会找到他的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22F29FE17421069C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:兽人翎":{"text":"루나애니 플럼","source":"兽人翎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}